msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Fused Attention Example\n"
"\n"
"This example demonstrates how to use the fused attention operator in MindSpore. Fused attention is an optimized attention mechanism that fuses multiple operations into a single kernel, thereby improving computational efficiency and reducing memory usage.\n"
"\n"
"## Overview\n"
"\n"
"Fused attention combines the computation of Query, Key, and Value with the attention scoring and weighting processes, reducing the overhead of data movement between multiple kernels. This is particularly important for large-scale model training and inference, as it can significantly reduce latency and memory footprint.\n"
"\n"
"## Key Features\n"
"\n"
"- **High Performance**: By fusing multiple operations into a single kernel, kernel launch overhead and memory access latency are reduced.\n"
"- **Memory Efficiency**: Avoids storing intermediate results, lowering memory usage.\n"
"- **Ease of Use**: Provides a simple API that is compatible with the standard attention mechanism.\n"
"\n"
"## Usage Example\n"
"\n"
"The following example shows how to use the fused attention operator in MindSpore:\n"
"\n"
"```python\n"
"import mindspore as ms\n"
"from mindspore import nn, ops\n"
"from mindspore.common.initializer import Normal\n"
"\n"
"class FusedAttention(nn.Cell):\n"
"    def __init__(self, embed_dim, num_heads, dropout=0.0):\n"
"        super(FusedAttention, self).__init__()\n"
"        self.embed_dim = embed_dim\n"
"        self.num_heads = num_heads\n"
"        self.head_dim = embed_dim // num_heads\n"
"        assert self.head_dim * num_heads == embed_dim, \"embed_dim must be divisible by num_heads\"\n"
"\n"
"        self.qkv = nn.Dense(embed_dim, 3 * embed_dim)\n"
"        self.proj = nn.Dense(embed_dim, embed_dim)\n"
"        self.dropout = nn.Dropout(p=dropout)\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self, x):\n"
"        B, N, C = x.shape\n"
"        qkv = self.qkv(x).reshape(B, N, 3, self.num_heads, self.head_dim).permute(2, 0, 3, 1, 4)\n"
"        q, k, v = qkv[0], qkv[1], qkv[2]\n"
"\n"
"        attn = ops.BatchMatMul(q, k.transpose(0, 1, 3, 2)) / (self.head_dim ** 0.5)\n"
"        attn = ops.Softmax(attn)\n"
"        attn = self.dropout(attn)\n"
"\n"
"        x = ops.BatchMatMul(attn, v).transpose(0, 2, 1, 3).reshape(B, N, C)\n"
"        x = self.proj(x)\n"
"        return x\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Performance Comparison\n"
"\n"
"In typical use cases, fused attention can achieve significant performance improvements over non-fused attention implementations, especially when processing long sequences or large batch sizes. The specific performance gains depend on the hardware platform and model configuration.\n"
"\n"
"## Notes\n"
"\n"
"- Ensure that the input tensor shape meets the requirements of the fused attention operator.\n"
"- When using the fused attention operator, ensure that the MindSpore version supports this feature.\n"
"- For specific hardware platforms, additional optimization configurations may be required.\n"

msgid "融合注意力（Fused Attention）"
msgstr "Fused Attention"

msgid "本节实现了一个基于 **Triton** 的 **Flash Attention v2 风格的融合注意力前向传播内核**，适用于昇腾（Ascend）NPU 平台。该实现支持："
msgstr "This section implements a **Triton**-based **Flash Attention v2-style fused attention forward kernel**, suitable for the Ascend NPU platform. This implementation supports:"

msgid "**因果（causal）与非因果注意力**"
msgstr "**Causal and Non-Causal Attention**"

msgid "**分块计算（tiling）以处理长序列**"
msgstr "**Tiling to handle long sequences**"

msgid "**数值稳定性优化（max-shifted softmax）**"
msgstr "**Numerical Stability Optimization (max-shifted softmax)**"

msgid "整体结构包含两个核心 Triton 内核："
msgstr "The overall structure contains two core Triton kernels:"

msgid "`_attn_fwd_inner`：执行单个 query block 与 key/value blocks 的 attention 计算（分阶段处理 causal mask）"
msgstr "`_attn_fwd_inner`: Performs attention computation between a single query block and key/value blocks (handling the causal mask in stages)."

msgid "`_attn_fwd`：调度所有 query blocks，并管理 block 指针、accumulator 和归一化"
msgstr "`_attn_fwd`: schedules all query blocks and manages block pointers, accumulators, and normalization."

msgid "并通过 PyTorch `autograd.Function` 封装为可调用的 `attention` 函数，与 `torch_npu.npu_fusion_attention` 进行精度对齐验证。"
msgstr "It is wrapped as a callable `attention` function via PyTorch `autograd.Function`, and accuracy alignment verification is performed against `torch_npu.npu_fusion_attention`."

